.TH CHUVADI-READER 1 "November 2026" "chuvadi-reader 1.0.0~preview" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chuvadi-reader \- read, mark, arrange and protect PDF documents; view Word and Excel files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chuvadi-reader
[\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B chuvadi-reader
opens each \fIFILE\fR (PDF, Word .docx, Excel .xlsx) in its own tab. When Chuvadi Reader is already
running, the files open as new tabs in the running window.
Everything is processed on this device.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CHUVADI_TIMING=1
Print the time of each start-up stage to standard error.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/Chuvadi
Settings.
.TP
.I ~/Documents/Chuvadi Documents
Default folder for saved documents.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://chuvadi.in
.UE
